# PINN 
This project explores how to code a PINN using pytorch. This specifically explores the 1 dimensional heat equation
\begin{align}
u_t &= u_{xx}, \; 0 \leq x \leq 1, 0 \leq t \leq 1 \\ 
u(x,0) &= \sin(\pi x) \\ 
u(0,t) &= u(1,t) = 0
\end{align}
The PINN is tested against the finite difference method from one of my previous projects, and I compare both of them to the analytic solution.